{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52538","headline":"公庭春宴 · 陈元光","name":"公庭春宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风驱冻去，万品破阳辉。\n红紫粧春媚，罍樽试酒奇。\n公庭开月榭，农榼荐时牺。\n兴逐芳芬发，盃同蜂蝶飞。\n谁云佳节会，独与赏心违。\n信手捻红[瓣]（辨），粘衣尽紫蕤。\n阴移来日者，各赠满须归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}